# Pairs with RAllOrNothing. The poison's re-seed discards every poisoned saga's
# buckets, including one the export shipped as prepared rows because it is still
# in flight at the source. Its withheld terminals then commit it with no bucket
# on the keys whose buckets went. #4633 keeps a carried saga's buckets.
MODULE: RAllOrNothingPoisonSettleDiscardsCarried
TARGET: RAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the poison's re-seed discards the buckets of a poisoned saga the export carried as prepared rows
PERTURBS: PoisonReseed
BOUNDS: LossPath = 3, JoinStart = 0, SagaOutcome = 0, Shape = 0

--- FIND
                        ELSE IF APrep(snap, k) /\ rterm[k] = "none" THEN "pending"
                        ELSE IF ACarried(snap) THEN rpend[k]
                        ELSE "none"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: every poisoned bucket is discarded, carried or not.
                        ELSE "none"]
--- END
